WEBVTT

00:03.980 --> 00:04.980
<b>Wow.</b>

00:05.600 --> 00:11.530
<b>This area has heavy encroachment of plants,
but in its day, it must have been a large city.</b>

00:12.030 --> 00:14.030
<b>Don't you think so, Miss 2B?</b>

00:15.450 --> 00:16.370
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:17.320 --> 00:18.280
<b>There we go.</b>

00:18.450 --> 00:21.790
<b>Oh boy. You YoRHa Soldiers
really are strong.</b>

00:21.790 --> 00:24.170
<b>Can you really see
through those blindfolds?</b>

00:24.170 --> 00:27.040
<b>These are not blindfolds,
but special goggles.</b>

00:27.040 --> 00:30.880
<b>Anyways, why are maintenance androids
on the front line?</b>

00:30.880 --> 00:32.720
<b>I thought that was strange as well.</b>

00:33.050 --> 00:35.840
<b>That's not an efficient allocation, is it?</b>

00:36.890 --> 00:41.060
<b>It's something that they wish to do.</b>

00:43.350 --> 00:45.640
<b>Miss 2B, I'll be right back.</b>

00:45.850 --> 00:49.770
<b>Um, I'm a Scanner type,
so I can switch with you if you'd like.</b>

00:48.310 --> 00:50.650
<b>No. 2... Type B...</b>

00:53.740 --> 00:54.700
<b>Is it here?</b>

00:54.700 --> 00:57.870
<b>Yeah. The destination
is on the other side of this wall.</b>

00:58.910 --> 01:00.160
<b>This thing...</b>

01:00.160 --> 01:01.370
<b>Oh, that?</b>

01:01.830 --> 01:06.540
<b>One of our allies brought it here,
but it's heavy and we have no other way to use it.</b>

01:06.540 --> 01:10.250
<b>There are rumors
that it's part of a Goliath machine lifeform.</b>

01:10.250 --> 01:12.460
<b>But that's probably a lie.</b>

01:21.390 --> 01:22.560
<b>Welcome...</b>

01:24.140 --> 01:25.940
<b>to the Resistance Camp.</b>

03:05.740 --> 03:08.040
<b>RESISTANCE CAMP</b>

03:08.250 --> 03:15.540
<b><i>Everyone listening to the radio,
this is Morning Letter brought to you by me, 24D!</i></b>

03:15.920 --> 03:19.050
<b><i>Let's get started.
Today's weather is sunny!</i></b>

03:19.050 --> 03:22.380
<b><i>It's not like we're a nocturnal nation.</i></b>

03:20.340 --> 03:23.970
<b>So this is the Resistance Camp.
Miss 2B, first things first—</b>

03:22.380 --> 03:26.100
<b><i>We have no time to sleep as denizens
of a daytime nation! Just kidding.</i></b>

03:23.970 --> 03:24.850
<b>9S.</b>

03:24.850 --> 03:26.430
<b>Yes, what is it?</b>

03:26.430 --> 03:28.060
<b>You don't need to use honorifics.</b>

03:28.310 --> 03:31.310
<b>You don't need to add "Miss" to my name.</b>

03:33.310 --> 03:36.570
<b>Understood, Mi... No, 2B!</b>

03:39.650 --> 03:41.740
<b>You guys must be the YoRHa Soldiers.</b>

03:41.740 --> 03:45.200
<b>I heard you guys
helped out my buddies. Thanks.</b>

03:45.200 --> 03:46.660
<b>Oh, no problem.</b>

03:46.660 --> 03:52.040
<b>I handle the weapons, so come on by anytime
and consult me if you're ever in trouble.</b>

03:52.040 --> 03:54.420
<b>I even have treasured items ready for you.</b>

03:54.420 --> 03:55.330
<b>I see.</b>

03:55.460 --> 03:58.090
<b>Be careful, both of you from YoRHa.</b>

03:58.420 --> 04:02.550
<b>This Weapons Trader is quick
to switch talk to business like that.</b>

04:02.550 --> 04:05.090
<b>By the way, are there any items you need?</b>

04:05.090 --> 04:09.640
<b>We deal with chips and electronic drugs,
and also buy out—</b>

04:09.640 --> 04:12.640
<b>Hey, Supply Trader!
You're doing some business talk yourself!</b>

04:12.640 --> 04:13.770
<b>There, there.</b>

04:13.770 --> 04:17.310
<b>Is there something you don't want
inside that thing on your back?</b>

04:18.230 --> 04:21.320
<b>Come to think, what is inside that bag?</b>

04:23.860 --> 04:25.160
<b>That's a secret.</b>

04:26.740 --> 04:28.200
<b>You two from YoRHa.</b>

04:31.040 --> 04:32.250
<b>Can I have a moment?</b>

04:35.790 --> 04:38.290
<b>Sorry for pointing my gun at you earlier.</b>

04:38.670 --> 04:40.300
<b>My name is Lily.</b>

04:40.670 --> 04:44.430
<b>I round up
the android Resistance in this area.</b>

04:45.260 --> 04:47.970
<b>First of all, let me say thanks
for helping us out.</b>

04:48.180 --> 04:52.310
<b>Helping the Resistance is one of our missions.
No need for thanks.</b>

04:52.310 --> 04:55.230
<b>Now, now. Let's genuinely
be grateful of their gratitude.</b>

04:55.480 --> 04:59.940
<b>Miss Lily, I am 9S of the YoRHa Soldiers,
and she is 2B.</b>

04:59.940 --> 05:04.030
<b>And those floating around us
are our Pods, tactical support units.</b>

05:04.030 --> 05:05.320
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

05:05.320 --> 05:06.320
<b>What?</b>

05:06.860 --> 05:10.200
<b>Oh? Perhaps you know 2B?</b>

05:10.530 --> 05:11.580
<b>No.</b>

05:11.580 --> 05:13.000
<b>Leader.</b>

05:13.000 --> 05:16.250
<b>I heard that you got assaulted.
I'm glad you're okay.</b>

05:16.250 --> 05:19.840
<b>By the way, I heard someone sent
another rescue signal to the Council of Humanity?</b>

05:19.840 --> 05:24.550
<b>They sure keep doing useless things.
That, and I have a report.</b>

05:24.550 --> 05:25.720
<b>Are these rookies?</b>

05:25.720 --> 05:28.220
<b>Oh, Jackass, let me introduce you.</b>

05:28.220 --> 05:33.270
<b>These are YoRHa Soldiers 2B and 9S, in reply
to the assistance request to the Council of Humanity.</b>

05:33.270 --> 05:34.770
<b>Um, I'm 9S and—</b>

05:34.770 --> 05:36.020
<b>Wow!</b>

05:36.440 --> 05:38.850
<b>So you guys are YoRHa Soldiers!?</b>

05:41.610 --> 05:45.610
<b>I didn't send 2B and 9S down
in reply to the assistance request.</b>

05:46.110 --> 05:49.820
<b>We YoRHa Soldiers are soldiers
directly under the Council of Humanity.</b>

05:49.820 --> 05:53.040
<b>If we kept responding to each and every
assistance request from the Resistance,</b>

05:53.040 --> 05:55.080
<b>it would hinder our operations.</b>

05:55.250 --> 06:00.330
<b>The Resistance is fighting machine lifeforms
individually to begin with.</b>

06:00.330 --> 06:03.750
<b>They don't have
a clear chain of command as a whole.</b>

06:03.750 --> 06:05.340
<b>Then, why did you...</b>

06:05.550 --> 06:09.800
<b>The behavior of the machine lifeforms
has been strange lately.</b>

06:10.390 --> 06:16.310
<b>On top of that, we lost comms with the liaison
assigned to the area 2B and 9S are in now.</b>

06:17.730 --> 06:20.150
<b>Reconnaissance has the danger
of virus infection.</b>

06:20.150 --> 06:25.610
<b>And in those cases, if there are decoys
like the Resistance, they can buy some time.</b>

06:25.730 --> 06:26.690
<b>Oh no.</b>

06:27.240 --> 06:30.740
<b>We are fighting for the sake of mankind.</b>

06:32.910 --> 06:37.620
<b>Can I take you apart a little bit,
just a little bit, and analyze you?</b>

06:37.620 --> 06:40.250
<b>I-I kindly decline your offer.</b>

06:40.250 --> 06:45.670
<b>I see. Then dismantling that box
floating around you will suffice.</b>

06:45.670 --> 06:52.800
<b><i>Warning. Regulations state the act of intentionally
harming tactical support units will be punished.</i></b>

06:53.140 --> 06:54.850
<b><i>Destruction recommended.</i></b>

06:54.850 --> 07:00.480
<b>You guys have absolutely no spirit of contributing
for the further development of science!?</b>

07:00.480 --> 07:05.690
<b><i>Hypothesis. A dangerous request
not defined for androids is occurring.</i></b>

07:01.560 --> 07:03.770
<b>I don't have enough data like this!</b>

07:03.770 --> 07:07.400
<b>More. I need more data!</b>

07:05.690 --> 07:07.400
<b><i>Destruction recommended.</i></b>

07:07.900 --> 07:09.900
<b>Hmph! You cheapskates!</b>

07:09.900 --> 07:14.120
<b>That's enough.
Didn't you have a report?</b>

07:14.120 --> 07:16.160
<b>Oh, that's right!</b>

07:19.910 --> 07:25.420
<b>There are multiple sightings of a vicious
machine lifeform in the ruins area of the desert.</b>

07:25.880 --> 07:30.170
<b>It's a phenomenon that hasn't happened in the past,
so something might be going on.</b>

07:31.630 --> 07:35.640
<b>Miss Lily, we were also assigned
to investigate that same thing.</b>

07:36.180 --> 07:38.430
<b>If you don't mind,
can you trust us with it?</b>

07:38.770 --> 07:40.600
<b>You say that, but...</b>

07:41.100 --> 07:42.520
<b>It's fine, isn’t it?</b>

07:42.520 --> 07:47.070
<b>If the state-of-the-art YoRHa Soldiers
want to do the recon, that would help us out, too.</b>

07:47.070 --> 07:48.280
<b>Jackass.</b>

07:48.480 --> 07:50.820
<b>Then I'll bring the car over.</b>

07:50.820 --> 07:52.490
<b>That’s fine, right, Leader?</b>

07:53.820 --> 07:56.330
<b>We're fine with that, but...</b>

07:58.080 --> 08:00.330
<b>Just be careful.</b>

08:01.160 --> 08:03.830
<b>That settles it!
And so, let’s take care of each other.</b>

08:03.830 --> 08:05.330
<b>Yes, indeed.</b>

08:05.330 --> 08:08.380
<b>And if you ever feel like letting me
take you apart, let me know any—</b>

08:08.380 --> 08:09.630
<b>That will never happen.</b>

08:10.130 --> 08:13.180
<b>I'll just bring the truck over.</b>

08:13.340 --> 08:16.350
<b>Recon together with YoRHa...
That means data...</b>

08:16.350 --> 08:18.260
<b>- We’ll be heading out now.
- I can take as much data as I want.</b>

08:18.260 --> 08:19.180
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:19.770 --> 08:23.060
<b>2B, doesn't the desert
get you excited for some reason?</b>

08:22.180 --> 08:24.600
<b>YoRHa, huh?</b>

08:23.060 --> 08:24.600
<b>Not really.</b>

08:37.990 --> 08:39.030
<b>Everyone.</b>

08:42.290 --> 08:45.790
<b>I'm still fighting.</b>

08:51.210 --> 08:54.130
<b><i>The desert has a high temperature
and strong sunlight.</i></b>

08:54.130 --> 08:55.970
<b><i>Replenishment will be difficult.</i></b>

08:55.970 --> 08:59.560
<b><i>Both of you, please head out
after making sufficient preparations.</i></b>

08:59.560 --> 09:02.470
<b><i>Well then, Operator 6O over and out!</i></b>

09:02.930 --> 09:04.350
<b>She worries too much.</b>

09:04.350 --> 09:05.940
<b>That's a good thing.</b>

09:05.940 --> 09:09.940
<b>The operator in charge of routine comms
with me is a lot more formal.</b>

09:10.320 --> 09:12.070
<b>She treats me like a child.</b>

09:12.070 --> 09:15.570
<b>Isn't that simply a problem
with your own attitude, 9S?</b>

09:15.740 --> 09:20.580
<b>We're about to head into a dangerous area,
and the YoRHa Soldiers are so composed.</b>

09:20.580 --> 09:25.620
<b>2B and 9S, was it? I'm Jackass.
Again, good to meet you.</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:28.920
<b>The pleasure is ours, Jackass.</b>

09:28.920 --> 09:30.000
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

09:34.840 --> 09:36.130
<b>Oh, there it is.</b>

09:40.970 --> 09:42.470
<b>We're already here?</b>

09:42.470 --> 09:43.890
<b>No, no.</b>

09:43.890 --> 09:46.890
<b>We have to open the sealed entrance first.</b>

09:47.100 --> 09:50.270
<b>Yes. But why are we so far away?</b>

09:50.270 --> 09:51.900
<b>Oh, that's because...</b>

09:58.280 --> 10:00.490
<b>it's dangerous if we get caught in that.</b>

10:00.490 --> 10:02.910
<b>Now, we'll speed up a bit from here!</b>

10:04.120 --> 10:05.750
<b>H-Hold on!</b>

10:06.330 --> 10:07.460
<b>Be careful.</b>

10:07.460 --> 10:09.540
<b>Thanks, 2B. Wait a second.</b>

10:09.790 --> 10:13.090
<b><i>Recommendation.
Rapid extraction of assisting unit.</i></b>

10:13.090 --> 10:17.760
<b><i>Predicting hindrance of recon mission
due to loss of assisting unit.</i></b>

10:13.920 --> 10:16.760
<b>Jackass! Go back! Go back!</b>

10:19.760 --> 10:22.430
<b>DESERT ZONE</b>

10:21.720 --> 10:25.020
<b>Lately, there’ve been units
among the machine lifeforms that speak.</b>

10:25.020 --> 10:27.770
<b>Our leader was saying
it was getting a bit hard to work with.</b>

10:27.770 --> 10:31.150
<b>Indeed, we can confirm
an increase of those units, too.</b>

10:31.560 --> 10:33.940
<b>Machine lifeforms that speak...</b>

10:33.940 --> 10:37.700
<b>Machines without souls
are simply pretending to be androids.</b>

10:38.030 --> 10:41.820
<b>On top of that, the enemies
are making remarkable evolution.</b>

10:41.820 --> 10:43.830
<b>You saved us by coming in to assist.</b>

10:45.160 --> 10:49.920
<b>I'm sorry.
We didn't come here to assist.</b>

10:50.580 --> 10:52.840
<b><i>Warning. Enemy signals detected.</i></b>

10:52.840 --> 10:53.920
<b>Jackass!</b>

11:14.690 --> 11:17.030
<b><i>Scary. Stay away.</i></b>

11:18.610 --> 11:21.610
<b><i>Androids. Scary. Desert.</i></b>

11:26.200 --> 11:28.200
<b><i>No. Help me.</i></b>

11:32.040 --> 11:35.040
<b>I'll weaken that big one by hacking in.</b>

11:35.040 --> 11:36.920
<b>Meanwhile, please get the others.</b>

11:36.920 --> 11:37.960
<b>Understood.</b>

11:38.710 --> 11:39.970
<b><i>Help me.</i></b>

11:40.170 --> 11:41.050
<b>Hacking!</b>

11:45.550 --> 11:49.730
<b><i>You cry out for help as you attack.
You're a machine, after all.</i></b>

11:49.930 --> 11:52.350
<b><i>You're simply
uttering words in random order.</i></b>

11:52.980 --> 11:55.520
<b><i>The protection level
isn't all too different from the others.</i></b>

11:55.690 --> 11:58.030
<b><i>I think I can
make something of this fairly quickly.</i></b>

12:02.030 --> 12:03.160
<b>A door?</b>

12:14.670 --> 12:18.050
<b>One, and tu, and thunfofai.</b>

12:18.340 --> 12:21.720
<b>One, and tu, and thunfofai.</b>

12:22.050 --> 12:25.390
<b>One, and tu, and thunfofai.</b>

12:22.340 --> 12:24.510
<b>What is this data?</b>

12:25.760 --> 12:27.600
<b>One, and tu, and thunfofai.</b>

12:26.260 --> 12:28.310
<b>The hacking is getting more in-depth?</b>

12:27.600 --> 12:29.640
<b><i>Fun. Wonderful.</i></b>

12:29.770 --> 12:33.480
<b><i>Rule. Rule. 904! 904!</i></b>

12:34.480 --> 12:35.520
<b><i>Enemy.</i></b>

12:36.110 --> 12:37.940
<b><i>Don't get in the way.</i></b>

13:03.760 --> 13:05.840
<b><i>What was that just now?</i></b>

13:07.010 --> 13:08.680
<b><i>Machine lifeforms are...</i></b>

13:09.100 --> 13:12.600
<b><i>No, they're just placing data
in random order.</i></b>

13:13.350 --> 13:14.520
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

13:14.520 --> 13:15.440
<b>Nothing.</b>

13:15.440 --> 13:17.770
<b>More importantly, is Jackass all right?</b>

13:19.440 --> 13:23.440
<b>The face paint is similar
to that of past human collectives.</b>

13:23.440 --> 13:24.900
<b>I've seen something like it in the data.</b>

13:25.070 --> 13:28.660
<b>This information...
Was it obtaining this particular data from the mask?</b>

13:31.580 --> 13:34.410
<b>Marvelous!
Nothing less from the YoRHa Soldiers!</b>

13:34.410 --> 13:36.750
<b>Thanks to you,
I obtained great data! Thank you!</b>

13:37.370 --> 13:40.540
<b>Now, let's hurry ahead
before the enemies gather here.</b>

13:40.540 --> 13:41.840
<b>About our chat earlier...</b>

13:43.050 --> 13:46.590
<b>If you didn't come here for assistance,
and investigating this spot was your main focus,</b>

13:46.590 --> 13:50.180
<b>then you thought the Resistance
could be nothing more than a shield, right?</b>

13:50.180 --> 13:51.220
<b>That's not necessarily...</b>

13:52.140 --> 13:55.640
<b>Well, I'll keep that a secret
from Lily and the gang.</b>

13:55.940 --> 13:57.100
<b>Why?</b>

13:57.940 --> 14:01.820
<b>Even the Resistance
needs something called hope.</b>

14:04.190 --> 14:06.110
<b><i>Enemy signal approaching.</i></b>

14:14.410 --> 14:16.540
<b><i>Death. Run. Scared.</i></b>

14:16.660 --> 14:19.830
<b>H-Hold on. That thing just now!
A machine lifeform fled from an enemy!</b>

14:19.830 --> 14:21.000
<b>Is that even possible!?</b>

14:21.290 --> 14:23.250
<b><i>Run. Run.</i></b>

14:23.500 --> 14:26.550
<b><i>Individual target ID marked.</i></b>

14:23.500 --> 14:27.050
<b>Get back here! Gimme your data!</b>

14:27.590 --> 14:29.220
<b>I guess we should be going.</b>

14:29.220 --> 14:30.390
<b>Copy that.</b>

14:38.310 --> 14:39.350
<b>What is that?</b>

14:39.900 --> 14:43.520
<b><i>Analysis. Ruins of an area
formally used as residences for humans.</i></b>

14:43.860 --> 14:48.400
<b><i>Made of steel frame and concrete, numerous
individuals dwelled in these high-rise structures.</i></b>

14:44.190 --> 14:50.780
<b>HOUSING COMPLEX</b>

14:48.400 --> 14:50.780
<b><i>The structures were referred to
by names such as "Housing Complex."</i></b>

14:50.910 --> 14:53.530
<b>They intentionally gathered
in large numbers to live together.</b>

14:54.030 --> 14:56.620
<b>Was it dangerous around here in the past?</b>

14:56.620 --> 15:02.040
<b><i>Negative. They lived as a group for economic reasons
stemming from lack of real estate.</i></b>

15:02.330 --> 15:05.300
<b>I see. Humans are strange.</b>

15:07.590 --> 15:11.760
<b><i>Operator 21O to 9S.
Commencing scheduled report.</i></b>

15:13.930 --> 15:15.310
<b>Operator?</b>

15:15.310 --> 15:21.190
<b><i>Report. Indeterminate signal is causing
radio jamming. Comm status is unstable.</i></b>

15:21.190 --> 15:22.650
<b>An indeterminate signal?</b>

15:22.860 --> 15:26.070
<b><i>A signal differing from both
machine lifeforms and androids.</i></b>

15:26.070 --> 15:28.190
<b><i>Answer. Lacking data.</i></b>

15:28.190 --> 15:30.360
<b>Can you at least determine its source?</b>

15:30.360 --> 15:34.410
<b><i>Analysis. Speculating that
it is the center of these buildings.</i></b>

15:34.410 --> 15:35.780
<b>What should we do, 2B?</b>

15:36.200 --> 15:38.410
<b>Should we return to the Bunker
for now and contact...</b>

15:39.120 --> 15:41.330
<b><i>Persistent! Persistent!</i></b>

15:41.330 --> 15:42.880
<b><i>Oh, a mistake.</i></b>

15:43.080 --> 15:45.960
<b>It just said "Oh, a mistake."</b>

15:45.960 --> 15:49.630
<b>My gusto is starting to overflow!</b>

15:54.890 --> 15:57.310
<b>Android corpses.</b>

15:57.600 --> 16:02.600
<b><i>Hypothesis. This is due to the machine lifeforms
residing in this area.</i></b>

16:02.850 --> 16:04.650
<b>Why would it be in a place like this?</b>

16:04.650 --> 16:07.270
<b><i>Lacking information. Unable to answer.</i></b>

16:07.270 --> 16:08.480
<b>9S!</b>

16:10.030 --> 16:11.110
<b>This is...</b>

16:11.450 --> 16:14.450
<b>the previously assigned liaison.
But how...</b>

16:15.070 --> 16:17.120
<b>Hey, over here!</b>

16:18.040 --> 16:21.330
<b>Are you all right?
This area is dangerous...</b>

16:21.870 --> 16:24.750
<b>This is a machine lifeform, right?</b>

16:25.080 --> 16:27.250
<b>I've never seen a unit like this before.</b>

16:27.250 --> 16:29.840
<b><i>Analysis result. Machine lifeform.</i></b>

16:29.840 --> 16:32.880
<b><i>However, speculating to be
a special unit not in the data.</i></b>

16:33.550 --> 16:35.390
<b><i>What happened here?</i></b>

16:36.010 --> 16:38.810
<b>Pod, what's the distance
to the indeterminate signal?</b>

16:38.810 --> 16:41.890
<b><i>Signal is coming
from the building up ahead.</i></b>

16:51.900 --> 16:54.070
<b><i>Good weather today.</i></b>

16:52.950 --> 16:56.280
<b>This is amazing! So many samples!</b>

16:54.070 --> 16:56.280
<b><i>Hello how do you do.</i></b>

16:56.280 --> 16:59.740
<b><i>- Why why why.
- Good weather today.</i></b>

16:59.740 --> 17:02.410
